{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"양수인가요?","desc":"<p><code>x</code>가 0보다 크면 <code>TRUE</code>, 아니면 <code>FALSE</code>를 돌려주는 <code>is_positive(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"is_positive <- function(x) {\n  x > 0\n}\n","hint":"<p>비교 연산의 결과는 그대로 <code>TRUE</code>/<code>FALSE</code>예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"is_positive(5)","expected":true,"visible":true},{"call":"is_positive(0)","expected":false,"visible":true},{"call":"is_positive(-1)","expected":false,"visible":false},{"call":"is_positive(0.001)","expected":true,"visible":false}],"starter":"is_positive <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-303"}